# doubao-1.5 — 豆包 Seedance 1.5 Pro

## 基本信息

- **类型**：video
- **模式**：start_end_frame（首尾帧）
- **状态**：enabled

## API 配置

- **提交接口**：POST https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3/contents/generations/tasks
- **轮询接口**：GET https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3/contents/generations/tasks/{task_id}
- **API Key**：<your_api_key_here>

## 请求体模板

```json
{
  "model": "doubao-seedance-1-5-pro-251215",
  "content": [
    { "type": "text", "text": "{prompt}" },
    { "type": "image_url", "image_url": { "url": "{startFrameUrl}" }, "role": "first_frame" },
    { "type": "image_url", "image_url": { "url": "{lastFrameUrl}" }, "role": "last_frame" }
  ],
  "generate_audio": true,
  "ratio": "adaptive",
  "duration": 5,
  "watermark": false
}
```

## 轮询说明

- 每隔 5 秒请求一次，最多轮询 60 次（视频生成较慢）
- 请求方式：GET，无请求体
- 成功标志：`status == "succeeded"`，取 `content[0].video_url`
- 失败标志：`status == "failed"`
